    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Explains supervisor, swarm, and hierarchical agent topologies.",
      "Guides context isolation choices for delegated agent work.",
      "Provides handoff, consensus, checkpointing, and failure handling patterns.",
      "Includes framework examples for LangGraph, AutoGen, and CrewAI.",
      "Supplies Python utilities for messages, handoffs, voting, and circuit breakers.",
      "Highlights risks such as token cost, supervisor bottlenecks, and error propagation."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Does not run real agents or call model APIs by itself.",
      "Example code needs adaptation before production deployment.",
      "Does not replace evaluation of cost, latency, and quality.",
      "Framework examples may require current library documentation."
