        "scenario": "Intermediate coordination design",
        "prompt": "Design handoff rules for these agents: [list agents]. Include required state, acceptance criteria, failure handling, and when to return control."
      },
      {
        "title": "Map to a Framework",
        "scenario": "Framework implementation planning",
        "prompt": "Turn this multi-agent design into a LangGraph, AutoGen, or CrewAI implementation plan: [design]. Include nodes, roles, state, and checkpoints."
      },
      {
        "title": "Audit an Agent System",
        "scenario": "Advanced production review",
        "prompt": "Review this multi-agent topology for cost, context isolation, sycophancy, failure propagation, and observability gaps: [topology]. Recommend concrete changes."
      }
